--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (every web branch + state reproduced; native-idiomatic, not Tailwind ports)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Now Playing  : media present -> card { cleanNil(title) || "Nothing playing",
                 cleanNil(artist) || "Unknown artist", optional source chip, optional
                 status Badge: Playing->green / Paused->amber / else->neutral };
                 media absent -> "No media data".
  Navigation   : location present -> { destination_name present -> pinned card with
                 {convertDistanceFromSI(miles_to_arrival) + unit} and {fmtInt(min) + "min"};
                 else -> "No active destination" } + presence chips Home/Work/Favorite;
                 location absent -> "No location data".
  SI note      : miles_to_arrival is SI meters (legacy name); converted at the display
                 boundary via the MediaNavFormat distance port (km/mi/ft), never re-scaled.
  States       : loading (parent isLoading) / empty (both snapshots absent) / error
                 (parent QueryError) / data; orthogonal connection live|stale|offline
                 chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh. Lucide -> SF Symbols;
                 web emoji presence chips -> house.fill / building.2.fill / star.fill.
  a11y         : VoiceOver labels on header, freshness chip, refresh, both section cards,
                 status pill, presence chips, retry; Dynamic Type via Font.TS roles;
                 reduce-motion respected by the shared TSFadeIn/TSSkeleton.

